# language: en

Feature: Signal API get

    Scenario Outline: HeadlessApp_Get_Sensor_Value
        Given PAL set sensor signal <path> to <datatype> <value>
        When HeadlessApp get the sensor signal <path> of <datatype>
        Then the result should be <datatype> <value> on <path>

    Examples:
        | path                                         | datatype  | value            |
        | Vehicle.Occupant.Row1.DriverSide.HeadPosition | complex | {"X":{"type":"int16","value":0},"Y":{"type":"int16","value":0},"Z":{"type":"int16","value":0},"Yaw":{"type":"float","value":0},"Pitch":{"type":"float","value":0},"Roll":{"type":"float","value":0}} |
        | Vehicle.Occupant.Row1.DriverSide.Identifier.Issuer | string | THIS_IS_B_TEST_STRING |
        | Vehicle.Occupant.Row1.DriverSide.MidEyeGaze | complex | {"Azimuth":{"type":"float","value":0},"Elevation":{"type":"float","value":0}} |
        
